    <p>In 2026, social media algorithms have become unimaginably fierce. They all rely heavily on the <span class="hl">"Golden 3-Second Rule"</span>. If your video doesn't grab their attention in the very first moment, you've lost that customer forever.</p>

    <div class="note-box">
